  Cell["This older helper works with colorT, colorf and colorTrace heads, not \
the newer Feynman ColorGenerator and ColorStructure representation.",
   "Notes"], Cell["The rules use SU(3) numerical coefficients, including \
Tr[1]=3 and the 1/3 completeness term. It is not a general SU(N) reducer.",
   "Notes"], Cell["Repeated adjoint indices trigger completeness identities; \
uncontracted traces can remain symbolic.", "Notes"],
  Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
